<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-054" chapter-id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng" source-id="s-jinshu-054-sun-zheng-ws2605147">
  <p id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0000" ref="6k9_dku_2e4_AA">孫拯</persName>者，字<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0005" ref="6k9_dku_2e4_AA">顯世</persName>，吳都富春人也。能屬文，仕吳為黃門郎。<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0026" ref="05e_9bb_55a">孫皓</persName>世，侍臣多得罪，惟<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0037" ref="6k9_dku_2e4_AA">拯</persName>與<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0039" ref="wtz_smr_dwz">顧榮</persName>以智全。吳平後，為涿令，有稱績。<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0057" ref="69h_uhy_hta">機</persName>既為<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0060" ref="bmo_6e2_cfl">孟玖</persName>等所誣收<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0066" ref="6k9_dku_2e4_AA">拯</persName>考掠，兩踝骨見，終不變辭。門生<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0082" ref="4yo_s2l_5mb">費慈</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0085" ref="0yh_6bx_6h7">宰意</persName>二人詣獄明<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0092" ref="6k9_dku_2e4_AA">拯</persName>，<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0094" ref="6k9_dku_2e4_AA">拯</persName>譬遣之曰：「吾義不可誣枉知故，卿何宜復爾？」二人曰：「僕亦安得負君！」<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0130" ref="6k9_dku_2e4_AA">拯</persName>遂死獄中，而<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0137" ref="4yo_s2l_5mb">慈</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sun-zheng:p001:m0139" ref="0yh_6bx_6h7">意</persName>亦死。</p>
</text>
